  "notes": [
    "matlab-orchestrator itself is not scored: it is the router.",
    "Weights are deliberately small integers so a single strong term (e.g. 'kitti' 3) can carry a short prompt.",
    "A route below minScore must be reported as CLARIFY, not guessed.",
    "Power-electronics prompts (变换器/占空比/纹波) route to matlab-control-optimization because that skill owns the stability and steady-state analysis methods; there is no separate power-electronics skill, and pretending otherwise would misreport coverage."
  ]
